px-11\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 !gap-3.5\">\r\n<h4><a href=\"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artcarved_thumb.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"449\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2021\/11\/08\/art-carved-jewelry\/artcarved_thumb-2\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artcarved_thumb.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"600,600\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-title=\"artcarved_thumb\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artcarved_thumb.jpg\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-449\" src=\"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artcarved_thumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artcarved_thumb.jpg 600w, https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artcarved_thumb-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artcarved_thumb-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artcarved_thumb-50x50.jpg 50w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/a><\/h4>\r\n<h4 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\">Art Carved Jewelry<\/h4>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Role:<\/strong> In-House Designer, Friedrick Goldman <strong>Scope:<\/strong> Print &amp; Email Campaign Design<\/p>\r\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\r\n<p class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Overview<\/p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Art Carved is a heritage jewelry brand with decades of history in the bridal and engagement ring market. As an in-house designer at Friedrick Goldman \u2014 the parent company behind multiple jewelry brands \u2014 I contributed creative direction and design across print and digital campaigns for Art Carved.<\/p>\r\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\r\n<p class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">The Work<\/p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Working across a portfolio of brands under the Friedrick Goldman umbrella, I helped develop campaign creative that spanned magazine advertising and email marketing. For Art Carved, one of the most meaningful projects was contributing to the creative for their same-sex engagement ring campaign \u2014 visual storytelling that reflected a more inclusive vision of love and commitment at a time when that representation mattered deeply in the bridal category.<\/p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">The work required balancing Art Carved&#8217;s classic, refined aesthetic with a fresh, culturally resonant perspective \u2014 honoring the brand&#8217;s heritage while expanding who it spoke to.<\/p>\r\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\r\n<p class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Impact<\/p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">The campaign creative ran across national magazine placements and email marketing, reaching Art Carved&#8217;s broad customer base with imagery that was both brand-aligned and culturally forward.<\/p>\r\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\r\n<p class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Disciplines<\/p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Print Art Direction \u00b7 Email Design \u00b7 Campaign Creative \u00b7 Bridal &amp; Lifestyle Marketing<\/p>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col relative max-md:absolute max-md:inset-x-0 max-md:top-0 max-md:hidden md:z-0\">\r\n<div class=\"md:absolute md:right-0 md:top-0 z-20 max-md:w-fit max-md:self-end max-md:pointer-events-auto flex justify-end shrink-0 min-w-0 pr-3 items-center gap-1 !h-12 transition-opacity duration-150 ease-in-out md:opacity-0 md:pointer-events-none\" data-testid=\"wiggle-controls-actions\">\u00a0<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Notifications (F8)\">\u00a0<\/p>\r\n<\/figure>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artvarved_ad01.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"450\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2021\/11\/08\/art-carved-jewelry\/artvarved_ad01\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artvarved_ad01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"766,972\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-title=\"artvarved_ad01\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artvarved_ad01.jpg\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-450\" src=\"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artvarved_ad01.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"605\" height=\"767\" srcset=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artvarved_ad01.jpg 766w, https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/artvarved_ad01-236x300.jpg 236w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 605px) 100vw, 605px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":449,"comment_sta